 where does a PV come from if nobody made one, and what happens to the data when the claim is gone?\n\n🗺️→🌊→🌅 · **Voyage Progress: two sections of seven. The vocabulary is set; the mechanics start now.**\n\n---","ttft_ms":96344,"ttft_stream_ms":5376,"time_to_request_ms":55,"type":"result","duration_ms":122636,"uuid":"57238498-05d6-475e-9d70-b2bac41c92e9","queued_turn_count":0}
